<Base lang="en" title="Now"><article class="prose"><div class="now-head"><p class="label">Now</p><span class="now-updated">Last updated · {updated}</span></div><h1>Mostly writing code, writing words, job hunting, and seeing my own cases through.</h1><p>The career-ops thread is still active — sending PRs to this open-source job-search tool, from scoring logic to edge cases, fixing what needs fixing. Excel Ops is live: a spreadsheet workflow for AI agents, distilled from a real-work habit of reconciling messy, multi-source reports by hand. Plot Ark moves forward in fits and starts; no rush to tell its whole story yet. The writing section is mostly filled in now: the essay collection, fan fiction, an excerpt from Our Insync, and a running set of musings are all up, and the writing pages now have an RSS feed to subscribe to. On the case side, things have moved into longer processes: the small claims filing over worker status has been accepted by the court, the other side has appealed the CRA ruling, and the tenancy matter has slipped to next year because the other side was on vacation. I prepare all the materials myself; the public version lives in Case Notes and stays redacted. The site keeps growing from here — the Chinese writing hasn't stopped, and the English pages are slowly catching up.</p><p class="now-note">This page updates irregularly. The date is the proof it hasn't gone stale.</p></article></Base>

